    "is_free": true,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1857570/extras/86b46ee74ff358056d5e7196c06df1e1.avif?t=1743086763\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Nigelopia Mini Mix is a retro-styled 2D platform action game that takes place on the island of Nigelopia, where the rules of life don't apply and the people are wild, crazy and fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game here\u2019s got a very rich amount of lore and dialogue that takes some presentational influence from Japanese anime! A cool original sountrack, too! You can play through a 10 level campaign as any of 4 quirky Nigelopian friends, all with unique dialogue and some unique abilities. Finish \u2018em all, and the game will be 100 percent clear!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game was patched after launch to address many crashes and improve it as well, but the core remains the same!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1857570/extras/86b46ee74ff358056d5e7196c06df1e1.avif?t=1743086763\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Nigelopia Mini Mix is a retro-styled 2D platform action game that takes place on the island of Nigelopia, where the rules of life don't apply and the people are wild, crazy and fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game here\u2019s got a very rich amount of lore and dialogue that takes some presentational influence from Japanese anime! A cool original sountrack, too! You can play through a 10 level campaign as any of 4 quirky Nigelopian friends, all with unique dialogue and some unique abilities. Finish \u2018em all, and the game will be 100 percent clear!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game was patched after launch to address many crashes and improve it as well, but the core remains the same!</p>",
